<title>FRANCE: CGE sees Bouygues/Lyonnaise telecoms link.</title>
<headline>CGE sees Bouygues/Lyonnaise telecoms link.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jean-Marie Messier, chairman of Generale des Eaux, said in an interview with le Monde that he expected Bouygues and Lyonnaise des Eaux to link up in telecommunications.</p>
<p>&quot;In telecommunications, I believe that Bouygues and Lyonnaise des Eaux will end up uniting while France Telecom will remain a rival,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>General des Eaux is main shareholder in the Cegetel joint venture with British Telecom Plc, Mannesmann AG and SBC Communications Inc.</p>
</text>
